  "readmeFile": "ReadmeNuget.md",
  "releaseNotes": "# Feature Additions\n      - Added support for schemas other than the default DB schema.\n      - Added a feature to change the text color of tabs.\n      - Enabled multi-line support for LabelField, ButtonField, and ListElement.\n      - Added click events to LabelField and ImageViewerField.\n      - Added a flag to control sorting by user operation in List.\n      - Added API enhancements to Script (retrieve parent field, retrieve parent module, manipulate modules in PageFrame, configure query string retrieval for SearchField).\n      - Added ListPagingField.\n      - Added a caching feature for DB schema definitions.\n\n      # Bug Fixes\n      - Fixed an issue where linked text was not cleared when a search was reset.\n      - Fixed an issue where the IsViewOnly property was not properly inherited in fields placed in tab layouts and canvas layouts.\n      - Fixed an issue where the add and delete buttons were not hidden in ListField when in view-only mode.\n\n      # Adjustments\n      - Adjusted behavior when the Home text in PageFrame is not set.",
